      "id": "claim_64342bb8b76e4f54876499b98523a870",
      "statement": "The peer template establishes the client/server boundary: a peer gets a client address and peer-specific private and preshared material, references the server public key, and connects to the configured server endpoint with the configured allowed-IP policy.",
